The basis is orthonormal: $\begin{aligned}
  \braket{+}{+}&=1,
  &\braket{-}{-}&=1,
  \notag\\
  \braket{+}{-}&=0,
  &\braket{-}{+}&=0.
  \end{aligned}$ For example, $\braket{+}{-}
  =
  \begin{pmatrix}1&0\end{pmatrix}
  \begin{pmatrix}0\\1\end{pmatrix}
  =0.$

